  "details": "1. Enable a menu color theme, any of the default ones will do (but Embers has the worst contrast)\n\n2. Notice the bottom 4 quick actions are hard to read.\n\nProblem: The default theme makes these buttons black with dimmed text and icons. Custom themes override these buttons with theme colors which are usually bright, but the text and icons are still dimmed. This makes them more difficult to read than the other buttons.",
